WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.225
What does this support?

2
00:00:01.225 --> 00:00:04.935
The build check shows the template
is the reviewed baseline,

3
00:00:04.935 --> 00:00:07.012
configuration management C M two.

4
00:00:07.012 --> 00:00:11.358
The validation record supports C M
two and change control, C M three,

5
00:00:11.358 --> 00:00:16.413
and catching a portal edit before it
replaces the template supports C M three.

6
00:00:16.413 --> 00:00:20.898
The dangers are the four edits you
just saw: an export committed as is,

7
00:00:20.898 --> 00:00:25.463
a widened look-back, a query on another
workspace, and a missing banner.

8
00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:26.650
Each has its check.

9
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:31.420
Next, Chapter 3 shows what each tab
would display, without a tenant.
